OL,3,GNEWSAUnleashed dog killed sheep and
OL,4,Aforced others onto rocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owners of a North Ayrshire farm
OL,7,Fhave appealed for people to keep their
OL,8,Fpets on a leash after a sheep was
OL,9,Fkilled and dozens of others chased onto
OL,10,Frocks by a dog.
OL,12,FArdneil Farm usually has livestock
OL,13,Fgrazing in a field between Portencross
OL,14,Fand Hunterston for about six weeks each
OL,15,Fyear, and large signs are placed around
OL,16,Fthe area asking that any passers-by to
OL,17,Fkeep their animals on a leash.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
