OL,3,GNEWSAUnleashed dog killed sheep and
OL,4,Aforced others onto rocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe farm's Euan Jack was alerted on
OL,7,FSunday afternoon to sheep panicking
OL,8,Faround the field. By the time he
OL,9,Farrived one sheep was badly injured,
OL,10,Fand later died.
OL,12,FJack told BBC Scotland News the flock
OL,13,Fhad been chased for half an hour, with
OL,14,Fsome sheep injured after climbing onto
OL,15,Fnearby rocks.
